   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Find a news story online from a news outlet of your choice such as NBC, CNN, etc. Then, select one of today’s top stories. Copy the material into a new Doc. Make some formatting changes to the document such as changing the font style or line spacing as you learned in a previous section. Then, examine the version history. Use the version history to look at the changes you made.",
